# Chat Session Report - Discipline UX Polish

### Session Summary
- **Date:** November 2025
- **Version:** 0.10.3 → 0.10.4 (Patch Increment)
- **Work Type:** Character Creator UX & Styling Tweaks

### What We Accomplished

#### 1. Discipline Button State Clarity
- **Shared Disabled Styling** – Reused the modern discipline system toggles so out-of-clan buttons add the `.discipline-disabled` marker, lower opacity, and show tooltips describing the restriction.
- **Caitiff Handling** – Ensured Caitiff resets strip any disabled/opacity changes so their universal access looks distinct.

#### 2. Popover Stickiness & Positioning
- **Viewport-Aware Placement** – Replaced the legacy right-only calculation with smart left/right swapping, axis clamping, and a 4px gap to hug the hovered button.
- **Hover Persistence** – Added cross-element timers that keep the popover open while traveling between the button and modal body, preventing premature closings.

#### 3. Modal Density Adjustments
- **Cost Line Spacing** – Reduced the vertical gap above/below the cost row for each power.
- **Description Compression** – Cut the trailing margin after descriptions so stacked powers read as a continuous list.

### Technical Implementation Details

#### `lotn_char_create.php`
- Updated the inline discipline availability helper to apply the shared disabled styles, cursor, opacity, and tooltips.
- Revised the popover placement routine to anchor against `getBoundingClientRect()` data, flip sides when needed, clamp to viewport bounds, and manage hover target classes.

#### `js/modules/systems/DisciplineSystem.js`
- Centralized popover state with `currentPopoverButton`, hover timers, and helper guards (`clearPopoverHideTimer`, `startPopoverHideTimer`, `isHoveringPopoverOrButton`).
- Extended mouse enter/leave handlers to respect the new timers, avoiding flicker when moving between the trigger and popover.
- Recalibrated positioning margins and ensured Caitiff toggles reuse the shared styles when clan restrictions change.

#### `css/style.css`
- Tightened `.power-cost` and `.power-description` spacing to align with the modal’s compact layout service.

#### `VERSION.md`
- Logged the 0.10.4 patch notes summarizing the discipline UX refinements.

